[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0010","text":"（彩排要开始了……\n　日花，没事吧……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0011","text":"节目工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0020","text":"七草小姐到了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0021","text":"共演者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0030","text":"请多指教—！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0040","text":"咦？\n七草酱，服装的感觉不一样了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0050","text":"（日花……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0060","text":"……啊，是的！\n是283事务所的新东西！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0070","text":"真的假的！\n新七草啊！　好耀眼！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0080","text":"啊哈哈\n您是在夸服装呢？　还是在夸我呢～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0090","text":"（日花……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0100","text":"不管您夸哪个\n都请到镜头前再说哦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400200_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
